{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Touhou Chronicle of Youkai Prayers",
    "steam_appid": 3295190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Touhou Chronicle of Youkai Prayers&quot; is a 2.5D pixel roguelike action game. It tells the adventure story of Flandre Scarlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/b0e936f3ca99f5402a50910fa21c9e8a.avif?t=1751761184\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can enjoy exhilarating combat and the thrill of countering enemies. It's a game where you only need to wield a single melee weapon to experience a variety of different skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/0b98803d94240d2c6c4f3f8c8c247120.poster.avif?t=1751761184\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/0b98803d94240d2c6c4f3f8c8c247120.webm?t=1751761184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/0b98803d94240d2c6c4f3f8c8c247120.mp4?t=1751761184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can trigger skills by defeating enemies or counter their abilities, which in turn generates new skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's the Spell Card skills triggered by defeating enemies or the countered enemy abilities, you can modify them using enhancement cards. This adds layers of depth to the gameplay, making the experience much richer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/f8f990189ff1ce421768222e367fa619.poster.avif?t=1751761184\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/f8f990189ff1ce421768222e367fa619.webm?t=1751761184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/f8f990189ff1ce421768222e367fa619.mp4?t=1751761184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy melee attacks will also create a parry effect when they collide with your melee strikes, significantly enhancing the interactivity of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's completion mechanism is very unique. You don\u2019t have to defeat all the enemies; instead, you can strategically choose which ones to take down. This will greatly enhance your combat efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/0478288f1129cd1eb13ee9dc0fdaa86a.poster.avif?t=1751761184\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/0478288f1129cd1eb13ee9dc0fdaa86a.webm?t=1751761184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/0478288f1129cd1eb13ee9dc0fdaa86a.mp4?t=1751761184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interactive elements in the scenes are quite abundant, allowing you to enjoy attacking and even destroying them with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you can unlock more functional cards, making the gameplay even more diverse and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come join this wonderful Gensokyo for an exhilarating and thrilling adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Touhou Chronicle of Youkai Prayers&quot; is a 2.5D pixel roguelike action game. It tells the adventure story of Flandre Scarlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/b0e936f3ca99f5402a50910fa21c9e8a.avif?t=1751761184\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you can enjoy exhilarating combat and the thrill of countering enemies. It's a game where you only need to wield a single melee weapon to experience a variety of different skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/0b98803d94240d2c6c4f3f8c8c247120.poster.avif?t=1751761184\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/0b98803d94240d2c6c4f3f8c8c247120.webm?t=1751761184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/0b98803d94240d2c6c4f3f8c8c247120.mp4?t=1751761184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can trigger skills by defeating enemies or counter their abilities, which in turn generates new skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's the Spell Card skills triggered by defeating enemies or the countered enemy abilities, you can modify them using enhancement cards. This adds layers of depth to the gameplay, making the experience much richer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/f8f990189ff1ce421768222e367fa619.poster.avif?t=1751761184\" width=616 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/f8f990189ff1ce421768222e367fa619.webm?t=1751761184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/f8f990189ff1ce421768222e367fa619.mp4?t=1751761184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy melee attacks will also create a parry effect when they collide with your melee strikes, significantly enhancing the interactivity of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's completion mechanism is very unique. You don\u2019t have to defeat all the enemies; instead, you can strategically choose which ones to take down. This will greatly enhance your combat efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/0478288f1129cd1eb13ee9dc0fdaa86a.poster.avif?t=1751761184\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/0478288f1129cd1eb13ee9dc0fdaa86a.webm?t=1751761184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295190/extras/0478288f1129cd1eb13ee9dc0fdaa86a.mp4?t=1751761184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interactive elements in the scenes are quite abundant, allowing you to enjoy attacking and even destroying them with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you can unlock more functional cards, making the gameplay even more diverse and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come join this wonderful Gensokyo for an exhilarating and thrilling adventure!</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Touhou Chronicle of Youkai Prayers&quot; is a Touhou fan-made roguelike action game.Due to a Kedama incident in Gensokyo, Flandre Scarlet eagerly takes the initiative to resolve it. Or rather, she's actually just causing chaos, definitely not trying to solve anything!",
